## 1.2.2

### Additions
- (1.20) Added Hanging Canvas Signs;
- (1.20) Added Cherry and Bamboo Cabinets;
- (1.20) Added salvaging recipes for Cherry and Bamboo furniture;
- Added compatibility with the `origins:meat` tag from the Origins mod:
